Dan Logcher wrote:
> I have an ES40 I want to connect to a Lantronix console server
> using /dev/ttyS0.  I changed /etc/inittab for cons, but when it
> boots to single or boot prompt, I got nothing.
> 
> What do I need to change in the boot params to make it console
> to ttyS0?
> 
