> 

When you are at the SRM prompt (aka "the three arrow prompt) you should 
be able to see it on the serial port and on the graphics head.

Try setting the console to serial explicitly at the SRM and then 
initting, like so:

 >>> set console serial
 >>> init

The serial settings are 9600,n,8,1 software flow control.  We are using 
old DECServer terminal servers for this same purpose.

Mario



